# Golden-image build context exclusions (#1087).
#
# The build context is the clean repo tree; the image must not carry the
# git history (bloat + history disclosure — every tenant image would ship
# the full object DB). The D-P1 pin comes from git metadata at build time
# (build-image.sh), never from the baked tree, so excluding .git changes
# nothing about the pin.
.git
.github
